      <title>Βερολίνο: Οι αρχές επικήρυξαν τους δράστες του μπλακ-άουτ με 1 εκατομμύριο ευρώ!</title>
      <link>https://www.europolitis.eu/2026/01/28/%ce%b2%ce%b5%cf%81%ce%bf%ce%bb%ce%af%ce%bd%ce%bf-%ce%bf%ce%b9-%ce%b1%cf%81%cf%87%ce%ad%cf%82-%ce%b5%cf%80%ce%b9%ce%ba%ce%ae%cf%81%cf%85%ce%be%ce%b1%ce%bd-%cf%84%ce%bf%cf%85%cf%82-%ce%b4%cf%81%ce%ac/?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=%25ce%25b2%25ce%25b5%25cf%2581%25ce%25bf%25ce%25bb%25ce%25af%25ce%25bd%25ce%25bf-%25ce%25bf%25ce%25b9-%25ce%25b1%25cf%2581%25cf%2587%25ce%25ad%25cf%2582-%25ce%25b5%25cf%2580%25ce%25b9%25ce%25ba%25ce%25ae%25cf%2581%25cf%2585%25ce%25be%25ce%25b1%25ce%25bd-%25cf%2584%25ce%25bf%25cf%2585%25cf%2582-%25ce%25b4%25cf%2581%25ce%25ac</link>
